  "project_description": "Enhances the core media library with the ability to modify the referenced media items. The changes to the media items will not be stored in the media item instead, it's saved as additional information on the referencing field. This allows context-specific changes on media items that are e.g. referenced on a node.\n\n Back to top \n\n Installation \n Patches are required. They'll be applied automatically when you install Media Library Media Modify via composer.\n\n \n Core: #3263397-16: Simplify form logic in media library \n Inline Entity Form (if installed on your project): #3271293-8: Changes are lost when collapsing a paragraphs subform including an inline_entity_form \n \n Back to top \n\n Usage \n \n Enable the module. \n Add a field \"Media with contextual modifications\". \n Have fun. \n Back to top",
